window.products.push({"id":556130,"name":"KawaDashi Tempura Deep Fryer - Japanese Deep Frying Pot With Thermometer, Drain Rack and Cooking Chopsticks, Dishwasher Safe With E-Cookbook Included ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tEdD83VdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"<p>🍲</p> PERFECTLY SIZED <p>🍲</p> - This mini deep fryer is perfectly sized for your cooking needs. Unlike a Dutch oven or traditional fryer, your tempura fryer is lightweight and easy to store, making it suited to any space! Frying in smaller batches guarantees that every bite is fresh, crispy, and won’t waste oil. Compact and portable, your fry pot can be brought to dinner and outdoor events. When the party’s over, it can be easily stored until your next culinary adventure. <p>🥢</p> BUILT TO LAST <p>🥢</p> - Your new tempura pot is crafted from Food Grade 304 Stainless Steel to ensure you have the best tool for the job. The stainless steel deep fry pot heats up quickly and can withstand high temperatures that are ideal for deep frying. Sturdy, versatile, and easy to maintain, it’s compatible with all stovetops. With a clever lid that doubles as a draining rack, it sports an ergonomic design to make cooking effortless, convenient, and safe. <p>🍤</p> STRESS-FREE CLEAN UP <p>🍤</p> - Your Japanese style deep frying pot is dishwasher safe, so you can skip the clean up after you’ve enjoyed your meal. The beaker spout makes it easy to dispose of excess oil, and the lid can be removed to better fit in your dishwasher and ensure thorough cleaning. <p>🥟</p> BONUS GIFT INCLUDED <p>🥟</p> - A downloadable E-Cookbook is included with every purchase so you’ll never be short on inspiration in the kitchen. Valued at $14.99, we’re including it absolutely FREE so you’ll be frying up a storm in no time. With over 20 recipes including Chinese, Thai, American, and Japanese style dishes to ensure you get the most out of your deep fryer. Discover new recipes and impress your dinner guests with delicious dishes from around the world. <p>🈴</p> GUARANTEED PURCHASE <p>🈴</p> - Our mission is to create an experience that fuels your passion for food. If you are not satisfied with your tempura fry pot, or in the case of damage, let us know and we will provide a full refund or replacement. No questions asked, and no hassle so you can shop with confidence.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71tEdD83VdL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KawaDashi","source_asin":"B092Z5KF57","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556130","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092Z5KF57","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092Z5KF57","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
