window.products.push({"id":556142,"name":"Tutmyrea 12oz Slim Can Cooler, Skinny Can Cooler for Slim Beer & Hard Seltzer, Stainless Steel Double-walled Vacuum Insulated Can Cooler for Beer, Sod","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BZV-CZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"KEEP DRINKS COLD FOR LONGER: Double-walled slim can cooler is made of food grade 304 stainless steel with BPA free rubber lid. Vacuum insulated cooler can keep your favorite drinks cold for up to 12 hours, 20X colder than neoprene cooler sleeves. NO SWEAT, NO BURN: Stainless steel can cooler with vacuum insulator is condensation proof. No matter how COLD/HOT your beverage is, the drink holder is comfortable to hold and no wet hands or water rings on the table. FITS 12OZ SLIM CANS: Slim can coolers work with all 12 oz skinny beer cans, hard seltzers or energy drinks, sparkling water and carbonated drinks. Gifted 2 stainless steel straw and 2 straw brush will be nice accessories to enjoy your cold drink. EASY TO USE: Simply push your can into the slim can cooler. The rubber lid will hold your drinks tightly. Your beverage will not drop even taken upside down. And you can take off the rubber lid to use the can cooler as a cup or to clean it. STYLISH PARTY STYLE: An indispensable can cooler in summer to keep your beer cold & fresh to the last sip. The 12 oz slim can cooler is excellent for pool parties, beach parties, camping trips, fishing, BBQs and big games.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/619BZV-CZ2L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tutmyrea","source_asin":"B096SCSB4Z","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556142","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B096SCSB4Z","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B096SCSB4Z","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
