window.products.push({"id":556147,"name":"LIBWYS Knit Christmas Stockings with Name Tags, 4 Pack 18\" Large Cable Xmas Stockings Classic Burgundy Red Ivory White Chunky Hand Stockings","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":19.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VqrY85RvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"18\" LARGE KNIT CHRISTMAS STOCKINGS. The knit stocking is 18 inches long. You can put a lot of goodies, cane candies, gift cards, chocolates in stockings. A perfect Christmas gift holder for kids. CUTE BURGUNDY RED & IVORY WHITE. Knit Stockings are designed in a classic rustic Christmas style with burgundy red, ivory white. It’s perfect for you to decorate the Christmas party and create strong \"Christmas festival atmosphere\". SUPER THICK WITH CABLE KNIT PATTERN. This thick knitted stocking is made of soft, plush yarn. Each knit stocking is handmade and the weave is even with cable knit pattern. This year, we added a lovely gift box shape embroidery. STOCKING NAME TAGS. Each stocking comes with a name tags, made of natural wood. Using them to label your Christmas stocking and enjoy the Christmas atmosphere, also can leave wonderful memories for child. PERFECT CHRISTMAS GIFT. Package comes with 4 Stockings, each stocking have the loop to hang it. They will look perfect hanging from the fireplace or Christmas tree. Santa is still able fill with goodies!!!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81VqrY85RvL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIBWYS","source_asin":"B09CD51ZZN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556147","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09CD51ZZN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09CD51ZZN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":556148,"name":"White Classic Luxury Aqua Bath Towel Set - Combed Cotton Hotel Quality Absorbent 8 Piece Towels | 2 Bath Towels | 2 Hand Towels | 4 Washcloths [Worth ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":39.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LUwRt7lBL._AC_SL1476_.jpg","description":"HOTEL COLLECTION - 8-Piece Bath Towel Set, Two matching Bath towels (27 inch x 54 inch), Two hand towels (16 inch x 30 inch), and Four washcloths (13 inch x 13 inch), plenty of room for comfortable lounging after a refreshing shower or relaxing soak. Each towel is spun from 100% combed cotton - soft, durable, quick-dry, and wonderfully absorbent. It is more absorbent than any Turkish Cotton Towel. WRAP INTO BLISSFUL LUXURY - At the end of a long day, or at the start of a new one, you deserve a little luxury. Transform your home into a sanctuary and your bathroom into a mini spa with the help of White Classic deliciously soft, comfy elegant towels. Fabulous selection of colors will make your bedroom look like it belongs in a magazine. Experience a true luxury super soft feel every time you use them. The surface is smooth and not easy to shed, adding to their durability. Edges are reinforced with double needle embroidered stitching to prevent fraying from long-term use and laundering. Perfect for spa, poolside, bathroom, Beach, salon, college dorm room essentials. CARE INSTRUCTIONS - Simply toss them in the machine and wash. After the first wash, these towels will fluff up beautifully, feel fresh and soft. These towels are specially processed to make the dryer take less time, thus saving time and energy costs. Keep The Lint Trap Clean. Some Lint May Be Observed in First Wash. This Will Not Affect The Look, Feel or Performance of Towel. NO RISK TO YOU! With Our 2-Year Warranty Promise - WhiteClassic is a different kind of company that prides itself on providing the absolute best customer service in the industry. If you are not satisfied with your purchase at any point and for any reason, you can contact us for a replacement, (in fact, you don't even have to send back the product).","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81LUwRt7lBL._AC_SL1476_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"White Classic","source_asin":"B0BPJWD5TW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556148","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BPJWD5TW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BPJWD5TW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
