window.products.push({"id":556168,"name":"Hanging Spice Rack – Set of 12 Under Cabinet Spice Rack – Durable Glass Spice Jars – Easy Access for Herbs, Spices and Seasonings – Modern and Chic Co","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b06vgwrxL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","description":"We made a mission in developing outstanding kitchen accessories and products to make your life easier and more enjoyable. That is why we chose only premium quality materials and use top-notch manufacturing technologies, to offer you chic and practical kitchen accessories guaranteed to exceed your expectations. Your satisfaction is of the utmost importance so we are always at your service to address any issues or concerns. Chic, Practical, and Modern – The Perfect Combination! Your kitchen will look spectacular with this hanging spice rack! Our rack comes with 12 glass spice jars that allow you to organize your spices, seasonings, and herbs how you see fit. Also, the jars have chalk painted lids so you can personalize your spice rack or split it into categories. Made with premium quality materials, this hanging spice rack is durable, reliable, and resistant, perfect to be placed under the cabinets for easy access to your spices. With such a practical design and modern aesthetics, our seasonings rack will make an amazing addition to your kitchen! Some of the amazing features of this product: Set of 12 hanging spice jars rack; Set of 12 hanging spice jars rack; Made with top-quality glass; Made with top-quality glass; Durable and sturdy; Durable and sturdy; Perfect to organize your spices and seasonings; Perfect to organize your spices and seasonings; 4oz spice capacity; 4oz spice capacity; Leak-proof design; Leak-proof design; Chalk painted lids; Chalk painted lids; No drilling required; No drilling required; Convenient and practical; Convenient and practical; Ideal for under cabinets; Ideal for under cabinets; 7.5-inch wooden frame; 7.5-inch wooden frame; Wonderful present for your loved ones. Wonderful present for your loved ones. Your cooking sessions will be easier and fun with our hanging spice rack!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61b06vgwrxL._AC_SL1280_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B08HY6V8RG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556168","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08HY6V8RG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08HY6V8RG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
