window.products.push({"id":556197,"name":"effuZen Cocktail Shaker Set - Liquor, Alcohol, and Spirits Mixing Accessories for Home, Bars, Restaurants - 8-Piece Kit with Large Bottle for Making M","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817tOAkfgnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Looking to give your bar and mixing skills an upscale upgrade? Cocktails can set the mood of an occasion, whether it’s a self-care party of one with your favorite Mojito, or you’re hosting a full-blown event for numerous guests. Anyone can make a cocktail, but there’s an art to creating delicious drinks that leave your guests’ palette wanting for more even after the party ends. If you want to create mind-blowing cocktails, you’ll need the proper tools. Impress guests and start mixing drinks like a pro with effuZen’s Cocktail Shaker Set. The shaker’s matte black body helps keep you grip tight and secure, making it even easier to practice your flair bartending skills. With a 24oz/700ml capacity, the bottle also holds more drinks than your average cocktail shaker. Serve more guests in less time. This is not your generic cocktail shaker set. These tools take the silver look of classic barware and mixes it with a modern, elegant black. It makes excellent decorative pieces when not in use, and perfectly accents industrial and contemporary homes and bars. Inside each box you’ll find: ✅ 1 x 24 oz/700 ml Cocktail Shaker with Built-In Strainer ✅ 1 x Double Sided Jigger ✅ 1 x Ice Tong ✅ 2 x Liquid Pourers ✅ 1 x Hawthrone Strainer ✅ 1 x Mixing Spoon ✅ 1 x Mojito Muddler Not convinced yet? Here are more reasons to start mixing drinks with this set: ✅ Includes all the essentials—no more, no less ✅ Comes in an impressive, unique packaging ✅ Durable, will withstand the wear and tear of preparing countless drinks Pour your inner spirits with skill and flair. Add effuZen Cocktail Shaker Set to your cart TODAY!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/817tOAkfgnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"effuZen","source_asin":"B07S5Y3W78","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556197","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07S5Y3W78","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07S5Y3W78","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
