window.products.push({"id":556845,"name":"12 Pieces Artificial Christmas Flowers Decorations,15cm Poinsettia Flowers Christmas Tree Ornaments,Wreath Ornaments Glitter,Xmas Garland Decor Red Go","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":7.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811niC-3IQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🎄[Package Include]: 12 pcs Christmas glitter poinsettia flowers + 12 pcs metal clips + 12 pcs stems.The diameter of the poinsettia flower is approximate 14cm/5.5in. 🎄[Material]:Poinsettia makes Christmas tree shine! flowers are made from high quality silk and plastic with glitter powder.The glitter powder may shed off when it comes.That would not affect exterior looking!Hope for your kindly understanding! 🎄 [Decorations For Christmas]:An additions for decorating garlands,rattans,gifts,crafts,mantle,Xmas tree and floral arrangements,windows,etc.Make your home or party full of festive and shiny feeling. 🎄[How to use]:Insert the clip(or stem) tip into the Christmas flower base tube then apply them to anywhere you like.Note:It might have smell when you open the package.Just air it out for 1-2 days. The smell will go away. 🎄 [Best DIY Decoration]:Our glitter artificial poinsettia flowers can be DIY decoration for Christmas Wreath or Christmas tree ornaments. Due to flower make of soft plastic material so they can be adjusted to your suitable angle and shape for decoration.The leaves color is bright and real touch,also glitter.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/811niC-3IQL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Knowfunn","source_asin":"B0B63229DW","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556845","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B63229DW","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B63229DW","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":556846,"name":"BBQ-Toro Digital Meat Thermometer Super Fast and Accurate Food Thermometer Cooking BBQ Kitchen Oven Candy with Long Probe LCD Storage Bag Included","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rzMmLe-yL._SL1500_.jpg","description":"BBQ-TORO Meat Thermometer with bag BBQ TORO meat thermometer can quickly measure the current temperature in Celsius and in Fahrenheit. It has an extensive measuring range from -58 °F to + 572 °F with a measurement accuracy of +/-1 °F. The long probe can be inserted deeply, e.g. to determine the core temperature of your meal. In addition to this, it keeps your hands away from burning.The slim probe tip avoids big holes, allowing hardly any juice to leak, so your meat stays tasty. The thermometer is a perfect accessory for your kitchen, but also highly versatile in your household, e.g. for baby food.   The measured value can be read easily on the large LCD display. The meat thermometer also has an integrated auto off function - it turns off automatically after 10 minutes of no use to safe battery power. It can easily be cleanded and stored in the included plastic tube and storage bag. Highlights - Lenght thermometer: ca. 9.4 inch - Lenght probe: ca. 5.8 inch  - Diameter probe: ca. Ø 0.2 inch - Material probe: Stainless steel - Material handle: Plastic - Weight: ca. 0,05 lb - Battery: 1x LR-44 (1.5 button battery included) - Perfect for BBQ, Grilling, Liquid, Food, Baking, Fryer, Bath, ... - Measurement: -58°F to +572°F - Temperature accurancy: +/-1°F - Power-saving mode after 10 min - Memory function for previous measurements - Display mode for °C/°F - Easy cleaning - Package included: 1x meat thermometer, 1x plastic tube, 1x storage bag - Brand product by BBQ-Toro Never leave the thermometer in a closed oven/smoker/BBQ!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81rzMmLe-yL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BBQ-Toro","source_asin":"B07F9YNRP4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556846","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07F9YNRP4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07F9YNRP4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
