window.products.push({"id":556855,"name":"Magnet Explore Mars Planet Retro Space Exploration NASA Travel Magnet Vinyl Magnetic Sheet for Lockers, Cars, Signs, Refrigerator 5\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":5.95,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713oKMR2SNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Magnets are printed in high resolution to capture every detail of the image. We make our Magnets with premium .30 mil vinyl to withstand exposure to wind, rain and sunlight. The Magnets are coated with a protective UV laminate that makes them super durable and resistant to fading, tearing, and water. Depending on conditions, our Magnets are fade resistant for 3 to 5 years. Our Magnets will stick on just about any flat metal surface. Magnets are a great alternative to stickers as they are reuseable and can be moved easily.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/713oKMR2SNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Digi Magnets","source_asin":"B07MMJNYRY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556855","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MMJNYRY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MMJNYRY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":556856,"name":"101 PC Greenery Bridal Shower Decorations Balloon Boxes Gold- Blocks with BRIDE TO BE + GROOM + A - Z Letters and 40 Balloons- Engagement Bachelorette","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":28.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p-cFhH1FL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","description":"MAKE ANY CELEBRATION MAGICAL: Beautiful brides deserve beautiful engagement party decorations. Give your announcement photos a splash of color, add a dash of elegance to a bridal shower or spice up a bachelorette party with sophisticated decorations that light up the whole room. They make the most stunning table centerpieces and even liven up jittery rehearsal dinners! 45 BALLOONS + 5 BOXES + 51 LETTERS: Why buy balloons separately when you can get everything in one easy-to-use kit? Other bachelorette party decorations only come with a few boxes and leave it up to you to supply the rest. Our gorgeous set comes with five greenery and gold boxes, 45 beautiful balloons in metallic gold, sage green, nude and white! YouÕll also get two sets of ÒBRIDEÓ letters, two sets of \"TO __ BE\" letters and a set of \"GROOM\" letters, and A- Z ALPHABET letters to DIY any name! PREMIUM-QUALITY MATERIALS: To make sure your special moment gets all the attention it deserves, weÕve thoughtfully crafted each of our wedding shower decorations with high-quality materials that last. Our balloon boxes are made with premium cardstock paper and other non-toxic materials, and our thick, 10Ó balloons are built strong for years of joy-filled parties and celebrations. FRUSTRATION-FREE ASSEMBLY: With pre-folded boxes, a visual step-by-step instruction guide and easy-stick letters, setting up your engagement photo props is stress-free and oh, so easy! When youÕre finished with your decorations, just fold the boxes back down and break them out again when youÕre ready to throw another amazing event. Or, help someone else create a beautiful bridal party and share with a newly engaged friend! NO HELIUM REQUIRED: Forget about buying a fancy helium machine or visiting your local grocery store to fill up your bachelorette balloons. All they need is a bit of good old-fashioned air! Just blow them up, insert inside your transparent block decorations and close the box for some seriously stunning engagement announcement, wedding reception or bridal shower decor! Love it or your money back guaranteed!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71p-cFhH1FL._AC_SL1140_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REGAL DECORATIONS","source_asin":"B0C1J4P2TH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556856","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0C1J4P2TH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0C1J4P2TH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
