window.products.push({"id":556880,"name":"The Hamilton Collection Precious Moments You are My Happily Ever After Handcrafted Figurine","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":99.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718eM+hb8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Like your most-loved movies, the life you share with your special someone is filled with romance, comedy, adventure and even a little drama from time to time. But one thing is for certain; your favorite co-star in life will always be there, from the opening scene to the closing credits! Now, celebrate your love and love of movies with this Precious Moments® You Are My Happily Ever After Figurine, a limited edition exclusively from The Hamilton Collection.This charming Precious Moments figurine is fully handcrafted in fine bisque porcelain and painted by hand, from the date-night movie-goers sweet hand-in-hand pose to their matching wedding bands that glisten like real gold. Plus, the sentiment \"You Are My Happily Ever After\" at the bottom of this love figurine is the perfect ending to a sweet story. Strong demand is expected, so order now!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/718eM+hb8KL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Hamilton Collection","source_asin":"B01LTCV330","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556880","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01LTCV330","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01LTCV330","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":556881,"name":"CoTa Global Baja Beach Small Wooden Jewelry Box - Handcrafted Nautical Trinket with Seashell and Starfish Decorations, Tabletop Home Decor, Jewelry St","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":16.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x6LI6WJnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"THE BAJA BEACH RECTANGLE BEACH ROOM DECOR COMES WITH A UNIQUE DESIGN YOU WILL LOVE - The brown ocean box beautifully encrusted in seashells makes a great beach bedroom decor for your vanity table. Store your small beach trinkets with the charming wood box or use as centerpiece for the coffee table. Place as a bathroom ocean decor, an accent for your kitchen counter or as a pretty nautical shelf decor that bring the beach relaxing vibes. THE RECTANGLE SEA SHELL BOX IS FOR BEACH LOVERS - Nautical desk accessories like the Baja Beach Rectangle jewelry box decor are perfect for those who'd like to keep their small trinkets in one place while displaying a beach themed centerpiece. Surprise your loved one with jewelry decorations inside a sea shell holder display box. Cute nautical storage for those who love collecting sea shells in beach trips in a seashell holder box. INCLUDED WITH THE BAJA BEACH TRINKET BOX - Includes 1 Baja Beach Small Rectangle Brown Seashell Box with an easy to open wooden lid. The cover is adorned with tiny rocks, shells and a starfish making it a pretty small nautical decor and a sea shell box for your nautical knick knacks. Charming beach gift box to give as a gift and party favors for beach themed parties. The Rectangle Baja Beach Theme Box measures 4.25Lx2.5Wx2.75H inches. HIGH QUALITY BAJA BEACH RECTANGLE SEASHELL BOX - The brown beach trinket box is made form premium quality wood; a durable and lightweight sea shell jewelry box handcrafted with a smooth finish. The seashell keepsake box is painted in brown and compliments other pastel-colored beach themed desk accessories plus hinged lid is artistically covered with sea shells making it a lovely beach box storage for the shelf, desk, bathroom and bedroom. IDEAL USE FOR THE BAJA BEACH RECTANGLE SEA SHELL JEWELRY BOX - Decorate your vanity table, home library, bedroom and bathroom with the Baja Beach Rectangle Jewelry box. Delightful seaside decorations for home like beach boxes are eye catching accents for your beach themed home as well as a handy ocean desk decor for your home office. Cute small beach decor that holds valuable collectibles, jewelry, coins and trinkets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81x6LI6WJnL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Puzzled","source_asin":"B01MEGRPQU","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556881","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MEGRPQU","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MEGRPQU","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":556882,"name":"Circulon Steel 10-Piece Cookware Set","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TC1B5VCFL._AC_.jpg","description":"Product description Each pan is brilliant and strong. Made of the highest quality 18/10 stainless steel so it can shine through every occasion. Contains the patented Total Ti food release system exclusive to Circulon Steel - a combination of a unique Hi-Lo wave technology and a titanium tough composite beneath the most advanced nonstick formula available. Outlasts ALL other nonsticks - GUARANTEED! 10 Piece Set includes: 1.5 Qt. Covered Saucepan, 3 Qt. Covered Saucepan, 8 Qt. Covered Stockpot, 8 Open French Skillet, 10 Open French Skillet and 10.5/4 Qt. Covered Deep Saute.... Amazon.com Concentric grooves in the bottoms and an advanced, titanium-composite nonstick coating create a rugged, unique food-release system inside the pot and pans in this 10-piece set of mirror-finish, 18/10 stainless-steel cookware. The concentric grooves (Circulon's patented \"Hi-Low\" design) create narrow ridges to take utensil abuse, leaving the low, wide grooves unscathed over time. Clad in stainless steel for good looks and easy cleaning, thick aluminum disks on the pot and pans' bottoms distribute heat quickly and evenly. Synthetic handles--grooved on the sides for slip resistance--stay cool on the stovetop and are oven-safe to 350 degrees F. The set consists of 1-1/2-quart and 3-quart saucepans with lids; 8-inch and 10-inch slope-sided skillets; a 10-1/2-inch, 4-quart, straight- sided sauté pan with lid that's great for braising and cooking one-dish meals as well as for sautéing; and an 8-quart stockpot with lid that doubles as a soup pot. Circulon Steel cookware carries a lifetime warranty against defects. --Fred Brack What's in the Box 1-1/2-quart saucepan with lid; 3-quart saucepan with lid; 10-1/2-inch, 4-quart sauté pan with lid; 8-quart stockpot with lid; 8-inch skillet; 10-inch skillet","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41TC1B5VCFL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Circulon","source_asin":"B00006B13O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-556882","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00006B13O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00006B13O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
